<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'">
<title>netscan report</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0b0f14;--panel:#111821;--line:#1f2a36;--fg:#c9d1d9;--dim:#6e7b8b;--acc:#39d353;--warn:#f0b429;--bad:#f85149}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:14px/1.5 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,"Liberation Mono",monospace}
main{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px}
h1{color:var(--acc);font-size:18px;margin:0 0 4px}
h1::before{content:"$ "}
h2{font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin:28px 0 8px}
.meta{color:var(--dim);margin:0}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:8px;margin-top:20px}
.stat{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:22px;color:var(--acc)}
.stat.bad b{color:var(--bad)}
.banner-warn{border:1px solid var(--warn);color:var(--warn);padding:8px 12px;margin-top:16px}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line)}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:6px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
th{color:var(--dim);font-weight:normal}
.risk{padding:0 6px;border:1px solid currentColor}
.risk-critical{color:var(--bad)} .risk-high{color:var(--warn)} .risk-medium{color:#58a6ff} .risk-info{color:var(--dim)}
.banner{color:var(--dim);word-break:break-all}
footer{color:var(--dim);margin-top:32px;font-size:12px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>netscan report</h1>
<p class="meta">targets: 10.0.0.0/30 web.lan &middot; ports: 22,80,445,3389,8081 (5/host)</p>
<p class="meta">started: 2026-01-02 15:04:05 UTC &middot; finished: 2026-01-02 15:04:06 UTC &middot; duration: 1.50s</p>

<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat"><b>3</b>hosts scanned</div>
  <div class="stat"><b>3</b>hosts up</div>
  <div class="stat"><b>4</b>open ports</div>
  <div class="stat bad"><b>1</b>high/critical</div>
  <div class="stat"><b>2</b>closed</div>
  <div class="stat"><b>2</b>filtered</div>
</div>

<h2>Open ports</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Host</th><th>Port</th><th>Service</th><th>Risk</th><th>Note</th><th>Banner</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>10.0.0.1</td><td>22/tcp</td><td>ssh</td><td><span class="risk risk-medium">medium</span></td><td>Remote shell; enforce key auth and restrict source IPs</td><td class="banner">SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_9.6</td></tr>
<tr><td>10.0.0.1</td><td>3389/tcp</td><td>rdp</td><td><span class="risk risk-critical">critical</span></td><td>Remote desktop; brute-force and RCE target, put behind VPN</td><td class="banner"></td></tr>
<tr><td>10.0.0.1</td><td>8081/tcp</td><td>-</td><td><span class="risk risk-info">info</span></td><td></td><td class="banner"></td></tr>
<tr><td>10.0.0.10<br><small>web.lan</small></td><td>80/tcp</td><td>http</td><td><span class="risk risk-info">info</span></td><td>Web service; prefer HTTPS</td><td class="banner"></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<footer>Generated by netscan test. Risk ratings are triage heuristics, not vulnerability findings. Only scan networks you are authorized to test.</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
